; ── Regression (2026-07-02): a user local named with the march_ prefix
; (`let march_bin = ...`) must take the normal local-load path, not be
; emitted as a bare @global by emit_atom's march_-extern arm (the B9 arm
; needed the var_slot shadow guard; first hit: bastion forge/console.march).
(rule
 (targets native_march_prefixed_local native_march_prefixed_local.out)
